      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kazuma Okamoto finished 7th in voting for the AL Rookie of the Year Award, receiving one third-place vote. #BlueJays",
      "likes": 25,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-10T01:11:37.677Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwb3dvyac2e",
      "jp_players": [
        "Kazuma Okamoto",
        "Okamoto"
      ],
      "jp": "岡本和真がア・リーグ新人王の投票で7位。3位票を1票獲得した。#BlueJays"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kevin McGonigle is the American League Rookie of the Year. He is the first Tigers hitter to win the award since Lou Whitaker in 1978.",
      "likes": 93,
      "reposts": 17,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-10T00:24:54.885Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzw6hsxkoc2w",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ア・リーグ新人王はKevin McGonigle。タイガースの野手では1978年のLou Whitaker以来の受賞となる。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Back on #BlueJays this week. I expect we'll hear more on Anthony Santander tomorrow, when Ross Atkins speaks with reporters at the GM Meetings in Las Vegas. Hearing directly from Santander, who shared Islamophobic posts on his Instagram, should also be a necessary part of this.",
      "likes": 65,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 9,
      "at": "2026-11-09T13:38:11.819Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzv2dfhzic2i",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I don’t think there’s any reason we need to hear from Santander directly, his posts were consistent, extreme and wildly out of character for anyone who should wear the jersey. I know plenty of players are conservative, but that’s different than public hate speech. He should be DFA’ed ASAP.",
          "likes": 11,
          "author": "buddytheelf.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I've heard enough from Santander. I'm disappointed in the weak response from the blue jays organization.",
          "likes": 7,
          "author": "grilledcheese.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Any comments Santander makes would be meaningless. I don’t  want to hear a fake, forced apology. He won’t be contrite, he’ll just be doing what’s he told.  \n\nAlso: very disappointed in Sportsnet for their lack of coverage on this. Cowardly.",
          "likes": 7,
          "author": "seaflower-1.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I dont think i need to hear anything from that guy.",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "ckimberley.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "今週は再び#BlueJaysの話題。明日、ラスベガスのGMミーティングでRoss Atkinsが取材に応じ、Anthony Santanderについても語るはず。Instagramでイスラム嫌悪の投稿を共有したSantander本人の説明も欠かせない。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kevin McGonigle received 28 of 30 first-place votes from BBWAA members (two per chapter in AL cities), with Cleveland's Parker Messick getting the other two.",
      "likes": 28,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-10T00:30:05.390Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzw6r33fac2w",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "McGonigleは30票中28票の1位票を獲得（BBWAA会員が投票、ア・リーグ各都市2人ずつ）。残り2票はクリーブランドのParker Messickが獲得。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
