      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Cubs & RHP Bruno López have agreed to 2-year minor-league deal with invite to MLB spring training source tells Tribune. López, 24, spent last 7 years in Cardinals’ system. Dominican Republic native features fastball that sits 98-99 mph. Missed ‘26 season due to surgery to remove bone chips in elbow",
